 	(Definition~\ref{def:ideg-deg-polynomials}), and their total mass
 	satisfies
 	\[
 		\E_{(\ell,u)} \sum_{f' \text{ without an evaluation at } u}
 		\bra{\hat{\psi}}\, M^{(\mathrm{Line},W),\ell}_{f'} \ot \Id\,
 		\ket{\hat{\psi}} \,\leq\, O(\eps)\,,
 	\]
