1730		$i\in\{0,\dots,n-1\}$ and $u,v\in\F_q^n$ independently and uniformly,
1731		and chooses the axis or diagonal kind with equal probabilities.
1732		For the axis kind set $w=e_i$; for the diagonal kind set $w_j=0$ for
